## 2. Decisions Already Made — Do Not Relitigate

| # | Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| **D1** | **Collapse target is `architect-pm`.** | It is the only role Cost Plan supports today (`_cost_plan_capability` hard-rejects the other three); it is already the frontend create default; it has the deepest section-brief coverage. Every other target requires building capability that does not exist. |
