| **D6** | **Phases ship independently.** Each phase is one commit, CI-green on its own. | Allows stopping after Phase 3 if the remaining cleanup gets deprioritised. |
| **D7** | **If the four role seeds are merged (Phase 6), the merged role is named "project lead" — not "Construction Manager".** | "Construction Manager" is already used in this repo for the *agent* persona (`docs/plans/2026-07-05-cm-agent-persona.md`, `docs/acceptance/role-scenarios/construction-manager.yaml`), and in industry it denotes a specific procurement model rather than a generic term. "Project lead" is the doctrine's own existing abstraction in `docs/clerk-brief.md`. Full reasoning in §6.1. |

