### 6.8 Review gate

**Do not merge on agent output alone.** Sections 3 (statutory instruments) and 8 (claims/variations/EOT) require sign-off from someone who carries professional liability for construction advice in NSW.

Reviewer checklist:

- [ ] Every statutory obligation in the four source files still appears, correctly conditioned
- [ ] No obligation has been generalised from one position to all positions
- [ ] Owner-builder HBCF exemption survives, stated as a prohibition on the checklist
- [ ] LSL threshold and payer conditions intact
- [ ] PI insurance is scoped to design responsibility, not universal
- [ ] Non-NSW graceful-degradation callouts survive the merge (VIC DBI, CoINVEST, etc.)
- [ ] The evidence tests are answerable from the documents a real project actually holds

